millipede-caster for Debian
--------------------------

Millipede is a high-performance NTRIP caster written in C for the CentipedeRTK project, a network of RTK bases based in France (see https://centipede.fr).

Millipede uses libevent2 for minimal memory footprint.

It can easily handle tens of thousands of NTRIP sessions on a minimal server.

See https://github.com/pbeyssac/millipede-caster
